        ("Shade houses and potting sheds", "Nurseries keep shade cloth frames, stacked containers, pallets and potting benches that stay undisturbed for long stretches. A swarm can fill the hollow of a stacked pot tower or the space under a bench. Work around the plants is slow and careful so the stock is not trampled. See [[svc:nurseries-groves|nursery and grove removals]]."),
